     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Reading & Writing: Fill in the Blanks']::text[], 'custom', ARRAY['academic']),
    ('rp-pte-em-rwfib-122', 'pte-2026-01', 'As A Historian Who''S', 'PTE Exam Memories',
     '[{"label": "A", "text": "As a historian who''s always ____________ for the text or the image that makes us re- evaluate the past, I''ve become preoccupied with looking for ____________ that show our Victorian ancestors smiling. I''ve found quite a few, and - since I started posting them on Twitter - they have been causing quite a ___________. People have been surprised to see ________ that Victorians had fun and could, and did, laugh. They are noting that the Victorians suddenly seem to become more human as the hundred-or-so years that separate us _________ away through our common experience of laughter."}]'::jsonb, 0, 'medium', 'Academic Reading',
