     'In Reality, However, The', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'In reality, however, the causes of truancy and [[b1]] are diverse and multi- faceted. There are as many causes of non-attendance as there are non-attenders. Each child has his/her own [[b2]] story, and whilst there may often be certain identifiable factors in common, each non-attending child demands and [[b3]] an individual response, tailored to meet his/her individual needs. This applies [[b4]] to the 14-year- old who fails to attend school because a parent is terminally ill, the overweight 11-year-old who fails to attend because he is [[b5]] about changing for PE in front of peers, the 15-year-old who is ''bored'' by lessons, and to the seven-year-old who is teased in the playground because she does not wear the latest designer-label clothes.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["non-compliance", "non-sense", "non-attendance", "non-binding"], "correctAnswer": "non-attendance"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["unorthodox", "unique", "novel", "prolific"], "correctAnswer": "unique"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["deserves", "earns", "combats", "dissects"], "correctAnswer": "deserves"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["commonly", "equally", "instantly", "gorgeously"], "correctAnswer": "equally"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["ashamed", "shy", "embarrassed", "embedded"], "correctAnswer": "embarrassed"}]'::jsonb,
