     'The University of Maryland boasts 78 academic programs [[b1]] in the top 25 nationally and 29 academic programs in the top 10 according to U.S. News and World report. By drawing top-notch faculty, [[b2]] the brightest students and [[b3]] in the quality of our academic programs, we are a force to reckon [[b4]] on a national [[b5]].', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["ranked", "offered", "valued", "scoring"], "correctAnswer": "ranked"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["spreading", "holding", "attracting", "bewildering"], "correctAnswer": "attracting"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["progress", "investing", "stabilizing", "relying"], "correctAnswer": "investing"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["for", "about", "with", "in"], "correctAnswer": "with"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["scope", "basis", "phenomenon", "region"], "correctAnswer": "basis"}]'::jsonb,
