    ('pte-em-rwfib-043', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)',
     'Great Engineers Have A', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'Great engineers have a passion to improve life; a burning conviction that they can make life better for everyone. Engineers need to have a talent for invention and innovation, but what [[b1]] them is the conviction that they can find a better way to do things; a cheaper and more efficient solution to the problems of human existence on this planet of [[b2]] resources that we call Earth. Many of us [[b3]] a lot of time complaining about the difficulties and problems of life. It is easy to find fault with things that make daily life arduous. For an engineer, these difficulties can be opportunities. How can this be made to work better? How can that process be made more efficient? How can [[b4]] be made more cheaply, more accurately and more fit-for-purpose? Great engineers are convinced that everything can be [[b5]]. Instead of complaining, they think of ways to make things better.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["drives", "carries", "takes", "makes"], "correctAnswer": "drives"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["limited", "unlimited", "useful", "numerous"], "correctAnswer": "limited"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["take", "spend", "cost", "save"], "correctAnswer": "spend"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["parts", "elements", "contents", "components"], "correctAnswer": "components"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["improved", "created", "performed", "enlightened"], "correctAnswer": "improved"}]'::jsonb,
