     'The Recipe For Making', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'The recipe for making any creature is written in its DNA. So last November when geneticists published the near-complete DNA sequence of the long-extinct woolly mammoth, there was much speculation about whether we could bring this behemoth back to life. Creating a living, breathing creature from a genome sequence that exists only in a computer''s memory is not possible right now. But someone someday is sure to try it, [[b1]] Stephan Schuster, a [[b2]] biologist at Pennsylvania State University, University Park, and a [[b3]] force behind the mammoth genome project.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["predicts", "forecast", "foresee", "anticipate"], "correctAnswer": "predicts"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["human", "animal", "molecular", "organ"], "correctAnswer": "molecular"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["driving", "army", "moving", "carrying"], "correctAnswer": "driving"}]'::jsonb,
