     'Surely, Reality Is What', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'Surely, reality is what we think it is; reality is revealed to us by our experiences. To one extent or another, this view of reality is one many of us hold, if only [[b1]]. I certainly find myself [[b2]] this way in day-to-day life; it''s easy to be [[b3]] by the face nature reveals directly to our senses. Yet, in the decades since first [[b4]] Camus'' text, I''ve learned that modern science [[b5]] a very different story.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["surprisingly", "impressively", "implicitly", "roughly"], "correctAnswer": "implicitly"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["have thought", "thinking", "thought", "thinks"], "correctAnswer": "thinking"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["seduced", "supplanted", "secured", "supplied"], "correctAnswer": "seduced"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["encountering", "copying", "duplicating", "enclosing"], "correctAnswer": "encountering"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["cheats", "scales", "tells", "enlarges"], "correctAnswer": "tells"}]'::jsonb,
