     'Cells Are Now ______', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'Cells are now [[b1]] as a unifying concept. A cell is the smallest [[b2]] of structure and function. Thus, cells are the basic building blocks of all organisms. Cells vary in size. With few exceptions, individual cells are [[b3]] small they cannot be seen unaided. In 1665, a British scientist named Robert Hooke observed cells for the [[b4]] time using a microscope. A microscope is an instrument that magnifies an object. Most images of cells are taken with a microscope and are called micrographs.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["determined", "revised", "claimed", "accepted"], "correctAnswer": "accepted"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["unification", "uniting", "unity", "unit"], "correctAnswer": "unit"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["much", "ever", "so", "even"], "correctAnswer": "so"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["earliest", "first", "last", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "first"}]'::jsonb,
