     'When We Are Very', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.',
     'When we are very concerned about certain of our physical [[b1]] a nose that is stubbornly a bit too large, eyes that are slightly too far apart, hair that is not as lustrous as it should be - we miss an overall point about our relationship to our appearance: how beautiful we feel has nothing to do with the [[b2]] structure of our face or body. It isn''t what we look like that counts: it''s how we feel inside. Our self - assessments are in the end solely [[b3]] our relative degrees of self-love and self-contempt. There are people of ideal [[b4]] and exceptional beauty who cannot bear what they see in the mirror and others who can contemplate a less than svelte stomach or a no longer so supple kind of skin with indifference and defiant good humor. And at a tragic [[b5]] there are heart- breakingly fine-looking people who starve themselves to ill-health.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["gestures", "component", "pastures", "features"], "correctAnswer": "features"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["reflective", "objective", "conjunctive", "subjective"], "correctAnswer": "objective"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["called in", "based on", "ruled out", "summed up"], "correctAnswer": "based on"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["distortions", "apportions", "proportions", "abortions"], "correctAnswer": "proportions"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["humanity", "extreme", "feeling", "supreme"], "correctAnswer": "extreme"}]'::jsonb,
