     'Although a plethora of issues might result in drainage problems at present, certain situations have been witnessed which are more typical than the others. The primary reason behind crawl spaces and [[b1]] basements is that it is not possible to drain the water away from the residence appropriately. Most of the time, the reason for this happens to be the gutters. Either the spigots have become [[b2]] blocked or they are not pointed away from the house as needed, and the water is not following the appropriate route and is getting [[b3]] in locations around the base, resulting in structural as well as landscape damage. It has also been observed that several types of individuals require drainage solutions after [[b4]] a new landscaping venture. It is very important to grade your backyard, and even landscapers forget regarding this every now and then. Therefore, if you are thinking of beautifying your garden, always keep in mind to grade away from your residence!', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["intimidated", "inundated", "fecundated", "dilapidated"], "correctAnswer": "inundated"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["comprehensively", "obsessively", "submissively", "excessively"], "correctAnswer": "excessively"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["stimulated", "interrogated", "interrelated", "accumulated"], "correctAnswer": "accumulated"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["succeeding", "completing", "depleting", "competing"], "correctAnswer": "competing"}]'::jsonb,
