    ('pte-em-rfib-016', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'What Is Music? In', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'What is music? In one sense, this is an easy [[b1]]. Even the least musical among us can recognize pieces of music when we hear them and name a few canonical [[b2]]. We know there are different kinds of music and, even if our [[b3]] of music is restricted, we know which kinds we like and which kinds we do not.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "volume"}, {"id": "B", "text": "question"}, {"id": "C", "text": "examples"}, {"id": "D", "text": "knowledge"}, {"id": "E", "text": "issue"}, {"id": "F", "text": "classes"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["volume", "question", "examples", "knowledge", "issue", "classes"], "correctAnswer": "question"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["volume", "question", "examples", "knowledge", "issue", "classes"], "correctAnswer": "examples"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["volume", "question", "examples", "knowledge", "issue", "classes"], "correctAnswer": "knowledge"}]'::jsonb,
