    ('pte-em-rfib-017', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'Psychoanalytic And Behaviourist Elements', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Psychoanalytic and Behaviourist Elements of both the psychoanalytic and behaviourist theories are [[b1]] in modern approaches to personality. Advances in neuroscience have begun to [[b2]] the gap between biochemistry and behaviour, but there is still a great deal that needs to be explained. Without a consistent understanding of personality, how can we begin to [[b3]] risk takers? If we cannot, we will be unable to [[b4]] their genes with those of others.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "media"}, {"id": "B", "text": "confront"}, {"id": "C", "text": "compare"}, {"id": "D", "text": "sort"}, {"id": "E", "text": "categorize"}, {"id": "F", "text": "bridge"}, {"id": "G", "text": "arranged"}, {"id": "H", "text": "hit"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["media", "confront", "compare", "sort", "categorize", "bridge", "arranged", "hit"], "correctAnswer": "arranged"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["media", "confront", "compare", "sort", "categorize", "bridge", "arranged", "hit"], "correctAnswer": "bridge"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["media", "confront", "compare", "sort", "categorize", "bridge", "arranged", "hit"], "correctAnswer": "categorize"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["media", "confront", "compare", "sort", "categorize", "bridge", "arranged", "hit"], "correctAnswer": "compare"}]'::jsonb,
