    ('pte-em-rfib-018', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'Sharkbite Sharks Killed Four', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Sharkbite Sharks killed four people and bit 58 others around the world in 2006, a comparatively dull year for dangerous encounters between the two species, scientists said in their annual shark attack census on Tuesday. Shark bite numbers [[b1]] steadily over the last century as humans reproduced exponentially and [[b2]] more time at the seashore. But the numbers have been [[b3]] over the past five years as overfishing [[b4]] the shark population near shore and swimmers got smarter about the [[b5]] of [[b6]] into certain areas, Burgess said.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "grew"}, {"id": "B", "text": "increase"}, {"id": "C", "text": "spent"}, {"id": "D", "text": "flat"}, {"id": "E", "text": "thinned"}, {"id": "F", "text": "risks"}, {"id": "G", "text": "spend"}, {"id": "H", "text": "turn over"}, {"id": "I", "text": "lower"}, {"id": "J", "text": "diving"}, {"id": "K", "text": "significance"}, {"id": "L", "text": "wading"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "grew"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "spent"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "flat"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "thinned"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "risks"}, {"id": "b6", "options": ["grew", "increase", "spent", "flat", "thinned", "risks", "spend", "turn over", "lower", "diving", "significance", "wading"], "correctAnswer": "wading"}]'::jsonb,
