    ('pte-em-rfib-019', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'It Is Commonly Said', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'It is commonly said by anthropologists that primitive man is [[b1]] individual and more completely moulded by his [[b2]] than civilized man. This contains an element of truth. Simpler societies are more [[b3]], in the sense that they call for, and provide opportunities for, a far [[b4]] diversity of [[b5]] skills and occupations than the more complex and [[b6]] societies. Increasing individualization in this sense is a necessary product of modern advanced society, and runs through all its activities from top to bottom. But it would be a serious error to set up an antithesis between this process of individualization and the growing strength and cohesion of society.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "less"}, {"id": "B", "text": "larger"}, {"id": "C", "text": "objective"}, {"id": "D", "text": "society"}, {"id": "E", "text": "element"}, {"id": "F", "text": "uniform"}, {"id": "G", "text": "advent"}, {"id": "H", "text": "smaller"}, {"id": "I", "text": "factor"}, {"id": "J", "text": "individual"}, {"id": "K", "text": "advanced"}, {"id": "L", "text": "latest"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "less"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "society"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "uniform"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "smaller"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "individual"}, {"id": "b6", "options": ["less", "larger", "objective", "society", "element", "uniform", "advent", "smaller", "factor", "individual", "advanced", "latest"], "correctAnswer": "advanced"}]'::jsonb,
