    ('pte-em-rfib-023', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'The Transitions Which Occurred', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'The transitions which occurred in Britain around 100 BC, and after 43 AD (when the Roman Army [[b1]] Britain) represent the key points of socio-economic trend in Britain''s past. During the first century BC, the traditional communal form of life [[b2]] rapidly to a world where certain individuals become more important. During the first century AD, Britain [[b3]] fully a part of the Roman Empire.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "invaded"}, {"id": "B", "text": "shifted"}, {"id": "C", "text": "became"}, {"id": "D", "text": "entailed"}, {"id": "E", "text": "enlarged"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["invaded", "shifted", "became", "entailed", "enlarged"], "correctAnswer": "invaded"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["invaded", "shifted", "became", "entailed", "enlarged"], "correctAnswer": "shifted"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["invaded", "shifted", "became", "entailed", "enlarged"], "correctAnswer": "became"}]'::jsonb,
