    ('pte-em-rfib-025', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'We Don''T Have Any', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'We don''t have any databases on this sort of information. As well as that, these records of sound levels take no account of the fact that people vary in their [[b1]] of noise-so someone like me with years of working in acoustics might be very different from you in that regard. But anyway, even though these noise maps are fairly [[b2]] they''ve been useful in providing information and [[b3]] awareness. That noise matters. We need to deal with it and so it''s a political matter. And that''s important-we need rules and [[b4]], because noise can cause all sort of problems. Those of you who are city- dwellers know that things go on 24 hours a day.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "tell-tale"}, {"id": "B", "text": "raising"}, {"id": "C", "text": "regulations"}, {"id": "D", "text": "taking"}, {"id": "E", "text": "perceptions"}, {"id": "F", "text": "crude"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["tell-tale", "raising", "regulations", "taking", "perceptions", "crude"], "correctAnswer": "perceptions"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["tell-tale", "raising", "regulations", "taking", "perceptions", "crude"], "correctAnswer": "crude"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["tell-tale", "raising", "regulations", "taking", "perceptions", "crude"], "correctAnswer": "raising"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["tell-tale", "raising", "regulations", "taking", "perceptions", "crude"], "correctAnswer": "regulations"}]'::jsonb,
