     'Seventeen years ago, I walked through city hall for the first time as a staff member. And that walk [[b1]] something to me. I was a unicorn. There weren''t many people who looked like me that worked in the [[b2]]. And yet, there were folks committed to addressing hundreds of years of systemic [[b3]] that left some behind and many ignored. Where there was promise, there was a huge problem. You see, [[b4]], as it was originally designed, had a fatal flaw. It only laid [[b5]] for rich white men to progress.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "Closet"}, {"id": "B", "text": "reviewed"}, {"id": "C", "text": "pipeline"}, {"id": "D", "text": "building"}, {"id": "E", "text": "democracy"}, {"id": "F", "text": "dependence"}, {"id": "G", "text": "scheme"}, {"id": "H", "text": "pigeonhole"}, {"id": "I", "text": "inequity"}, {"id": "J", "text": "revealed"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["Closet", "reviewed", "pipeline", "building", "democracy", "dependence", "scheme", "pigeonhole", "inequity", "revealed"], "correctAnswer": "revealed"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["Closet", "reviewed", "pipeline", "building", "democracy", "dependence", "scheme", "pigeonhole", "inequity", "revealed"], "correctAnswer": "building"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["Closet", "reviewed", "pipeline", "building", "democracy", "dependence", "scheme", "pigeonhole", "inequity", "revealed"], "correctAnswer": "inequity"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["Closet", "reviewed", "pipeline", "building", "democracy", "dependence", "scheme", "pigeonhole", "inequity", "revealed"], "correctAnswer": "democracy"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["Closet", "reviewed", "pipeline", "building", "democracy", "dependence", "scheme", "pigeonhole", "inequity", "revealed"], "correctAnswer": "pipeline"}]'::jsonb,
