    ('pte-em-rfib-042', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'One Of The Things', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'One of the things that we are seeing is that we''re seeing more young people run for office, and the more people start running for office, they realize that local [[b1]] is what makes the most impact, at least here in America. So if you want, for example, some racial [[b2]] in your judicial system, vote for your district attorney, vote for your city [[b3]]. If you think that there''s disparities in our education system, run for your school board. So that''s one. But the other thing to send very clearly to politicians is that when young Americans voted their heart out. Young Latinos, youth in general, outvoted the people before them, but they''re voting on making a bet that their life will change, because the last four years could not have been [[b4]].', '[{"id": "A", "text": "government"}, {"id": "B", "text": "rockier"}, {"id": "C", "text": "councilman"}, {"id": "D", "text": "superior"}, {"id": "E", "text": "evolution"}, {"id": "F", "text": "organization"}, {"id": "G", "text": "reform"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["government", "rockier", "councilman", "superior", "evolution", "organization", "reform"], "correctAnswer": "government"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["government", "rockier", "councilman", "superior", "evolution", "organization", "reform"], "correctAnswer": "reform"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["government", "rockier", "councilman", "superior", "evolution", "organization", "reform"], "correctAnswer": "councilman"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["government", "rockier", "councilman", "superior", "evolution", "organization", "reform"], "correctAnswer": "rockier"}]'::jsonb,
