     'Early impressionist painters were considered [[b1]] in their time because they broke many of the rules of the picture-making that had been set by earlier [[b2]]. They found many of their [[b3]] in life around them rather than in history, which was then the accepted [[b4]] of subject matter for paintings.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "radical"}, {"id": "B", "text": "outcome"}, {"id": "C", "text": "subjects"}, {"id": "D", "text": "conciliatory"}, {"id": "E", "text": "generations"}, {"id": "F", "text": "creatures"}, {"id": "G", "text": "source"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["radical", "outcome", "subjects", "conciliatory", "generations", "creatures", "source"], "correctAnswer": "radical"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["radical", "outcome", "subjects", "conciliatory", "generations", "creatures", "source"], "correctAnswer": "generations"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["radical", "outcome", "subjects", "conciliatory", "generations", "creatures", "source"], "correctAnswer": "subjects"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["radical", "outcome", "subjects", "conciliatory", "generations", "creatures", "source"], "correctAnswer": "source"}]'::jsonb,
