     'Students are increasingly finding it necessary to obtain employment in order to subsidize their income during their time in higher education. The [[b1]] income helps to pay for necessities, to maintain a social life and to buy clothes, and holding a part-time job helps students to [[b2]] skills for life after university or college. Using a part-time job to cut down borrowing is a sound investment, as it reduces the [[b3]] that will be waiting to be paid off after graduation. How many hours'' students are currently working each week during term-time is not really certain. Some institutions advise that students should not work more than ten hours a week, and there are others that set a higher recommend [[b4]] of fifteen hours a week. There is no doubt that some students [[b5]] even fifteen hours a week.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "exceed"}, {"id": "B", "text": "outperform"}, {"id": "C", "text": "gain"}, {"id": "D", "text": "more"}, {"id": "E", "text": "limit"}, {"id": "F", "text": "extra"}, {"id": "G", "text": "fees"}, {"id": "H", "text": "debt"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["exceed", "outperform", "gain", "more", "limit", "extra", "fees", "debt"], "correctAnswer": "extra"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["exceed", "outperform", "gain", "more", "limit", "extra", "fees", "debt"], "correctAnswer": "gain"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["exceed", "outperform", "gain", "more", "limit", "extra", "fees", "debt"], "correctAnswer": "debt"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["exceed", "outperform", "gain", "more", "limit", "extra", "fees", "debt"], "correctAnswer": "limit"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["exceed", "outperform", "gain", "more", "limit", "extra", "fees", "debt"], "correctAnswer": "exceed"}]'::jsonb,
