     'Down the road, the study authors write, a better understanding of shark''s [[b1]] may help scientists learn more about what drives their choice of things like prey and [[b2]] . Some sharks are shy, and some are outgoing; some ar [[b3]] , and some prefer to stick close to what they know, information that could prove useful in making sense of larger species-wide behaviour [[b4]].', '[{"id": "A", "text": "Personalities"}, {"id": "B", "text": "offspring"}, {"id": "C", "text": "dangerous"}, {"id": "D", "text": "habitat"}, {"id": "E", "text": "patterns"}, {"id": "F", "text": "extrovert"}, {"id": "G", "text": "adventurous"}, {"id": "H", "text": "personalities"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["Personalities", "offspring", "dangerous", "habitat", "patterns", "extrovert", "adventurous", "personalities"], "correctAnswer": "personalities"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["Personalities", "offspring", "dangerous", "habitat", "patterns", "extrovert", "adventurous", "personalities"], "correctAnswer": "habitat"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["Personalities", "offspring", "dangerous", "habitat", "patterns", "extrovert", "adventurous", "personalities"], "correctAnswer": "adventurous"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["Personalities", "offspring", "dangerous", "habitat", "patterns", "extrovert", "adventurous", "personalities"], "correctAnswer": "patterns"}]'::jsonb,
