    ('pte-em-rfib-120', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'The American Executive, Unlike', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'The American executive, unlike the British, has no [[b1]] with the legislature, and this lack of [[b2]] between executive and legislature is one of the [[b3]] features of American federal government. The Constitution guarded against executive control by [[b4]] federal officials, whether civil or military, from membership in Congress.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "disqualifying"}, {"id": "B", "text": "subordination"}, {"id": "C", "text": "obvious"}, {"id": "D", "text": "coordination"}, {"id": "E", "text": "distinctive"}, {"id": "F", "text": "dissatisfying"}, {"id": "G", "text": "connection"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["disqualifying", "subordination", "obvious", "coordination", "distinctive", "dissatisfying", "connection"], "correctAnswer": "connection"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["disqualifying", "subordination", "obvious", "coordination", "distinctive", "dissatisfying", "connection"], "correctAnswer": "coordination"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["disqualifying", "subordination", "obvious", "coordination", "distinctive", "dissatisfying", "connection"], "correctAnswer": "distinctive"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["disqualifying", "subordination", "obvious", "coordination", "distinctive", "dissatisfying", "connection"], "correctAnswer": "disqualifying"}]'::jsonb,
