     'Studies Of Pine Martens', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Studies of pine martens in Scotland have shown that the diet varies [[b1]] with small mammal''s berries (in late summer/autumn) and small birds being the main foods. Recent work on a plantation has shown that martens [[b2]] their home ranges in areas dominated by forests and [[b3]] shrubs. Within home ranges, martens utilize areas of grassy vegetation within the forest which are typically associated with Microtus voles, for which a strong selective [[b4]] over other small mammals is shown.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "establish"}, {"id": "B", "text": "lately"}, {"id": "C", "text": "decision"}, {"id": "D", "text": "seasonally"}, {"id": "E", "text": "preference"}, {"id": "F", "text": "dense"}, {"id": "G", "text": "complicated"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["establish", "lately", "decision", "seasonally", "preference", "dense", "complicated"], "correctAnswer": "seasonally"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["establish", "lately", "decision", "seasonally", "preference", "dense", "complicated"], "correctAnswer": "establish"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["establish", "lately", "decision", "seasonally", "preference", "dense", "complicated"], "correctAnswer": "dense"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["establish", "lately", "decision", "seasonally", "preference", "dense", "complicated"], "correctAnswer": "preference"}]'::jsonb,
