     'As research has shown, emotions are contagious. And empaths are especially [[b1]] to others'' emotional energies. Because they''re so attuned to others. They can get easily exhausted in crowds, be drawn into codependent [[b2]], exhaust themselves trying to solve others'' problems, or burn out from too much caregiving. Yet empathy is also a gift that brings greater [[b3]] and understanding. Some of the finest therapists, doctors, nurses, professors, writers, designers, musicians, artists and leaders in many have been empaths.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "confusion"}, {"id": "B", "text": "relationships"}, {"id": "C", "text": "issues"}, {"id": "D", "text": "sensitive"}, {"id": "E", "text": "resistant"}, {"id": "F", "text": "insight"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["confusion", "relationships", "issues", "sensitive", "resistant", "insight"], "correctAnswer": "sensitive"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["confusion", "relationships", "issues", "sensitive", "resistant", "insight"], "correctAnswer": "relationships"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["confusion", "relationships", "issues", "sensitive", "resistant", "insight"], "correctAnswer": "insight"}]'::jsonb,
