     'There are a number of substances (toxic as well as non-toxic) which are being added to the environment by pollution-caused [[b1]]. These are, in fact, the undesirable consequences of modern civilization. These substances, which are continuously going into air, water and soil, bring about undesirable [[b2]] in physical, chemical and biological [[b3]] of our environment and the life [[b4]]of animals and plants.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "possessions"}, {"id": "B", "text": "changes"}, {"id": "C", "text": "events"}, {"id": "D", "text": "aspects"}, {"id": "E", "text": "processes"}, {"id": "F", "text": "intentions"}, {"id": "G", "text": "aspect"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["possessions", "changes", "events", "aspects", "processes", "intentions", "aspect"], "correctAnswer": "events"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["possessions", "changes", "events", "aspects", "processes", "intentions", "aspect"], "correctAnswer": "changes"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["possessions", "changes", "events", "aspects", "processes", "intentions", "aspect"], "correctAnswer": "aspect"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["possessions", "changes", "events", "aspects", "processes", "intentions", "aspect"], "correctAnswer": "processes"}]'::jsonb,
