     'The Silk Road Has', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'The Silk Road has often been [[b1]] for the spread of infectious diseases in the past between East Asia, the Middle East and Europe. While such a hypothesis seems [[b2]], there is actually very little [[b3]] evidence to prove that diseases were transmitted by early travellers moving along its [[b4]]branches.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "claimed"}, {"id": "B", "text": "concrete"}, {"id": "C", "text": "incorrect"}, {"id": "D", "text": "overrated"}, {"id": "E", "text": "various"}, {"id": "F", "text": "blamed"}, {"id": "G", "text": "plausible"}, {"id": "H", "text": "individual"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["claimed", "concrete", "incorrect", "overrated", "various", "blamed", "plausible", "individual"], "correctAnswer": "blamed"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["claimed", "concrete", "incorrect", "overrated", "various", "blamed", "plausible", "individual"], "correctAnswer": "plausible"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["claimed", "concrete", "incorrect", "overrated", "various", "blamed", "plausible", "individual"], "correctAnswer": "concrete"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["claimed", "concrete", "incorrect", "overrated", "various", "blamed", "plausible", "individual"], "correctAnswer": "various"}]'::jsonb,
