    ('pte-em-rfib-192', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'London''S National Portrait Gallery', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'London''s National Portrait Gallery is currently celebrating the fifty-year [[b1]]of photographer Sandra Lousada. The twenty-one portraits on display depict key [[b2]] in literature, film and fashion from the early 1960s. Subsequent to the acquisition of forty portraits by Lousada, the display at The National Portrait Gallery highlights shots taken between 1960 and 1964, many of which feature in Lousada''s book Public Faces Private Places (2008). Formal commissioned portraits are shown alongside behind-the-scenes photographs taken on films [[b3]] and unguarded portraits of sitters captured at home.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "sets"}, {"id": "B", "text": "elements"}, {"id": "C", "text": "status"}, {"id": "D", "text": "career"}, {"id": "E", "text": "figures"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["sets", "elements", "status", "career", "figures"], "correctAnswer": "career"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["sets", "elements", "status", "career", "figures"], "correctAnswer": "figures"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["sets", "elements", "status", "career", "figures"], "correctAnswer": "sets"}]'::jsonb,
