     'To Qualify As A', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'To qualify as a conservancy, a committee must define the conservancy''s boundary, elect a [[b1]] conservancy committee, negotiate a legal constitution, prove the committee''s ability to [[b2]] funds, and produce an acceptable plan for [[b3]] distribution of wildlife-related benefits. Once approved, registered conservancies acquire the [[b4]] to a sustainable wildlife [[b5]], set by the ministry.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "equitable"}, {"id": "B", "text": "consecutive"}, {"id": "C", "text": "representative"}, {"id": "D", "text": "deposit"}, {"id": "E", "text": "rights"}, {"id": "F", "text": "quotation"}, {"id": "G", "text": "infringements"}, {"id": "H", "text": "quota"}, {"id": "I", "text": "irresistible"}, {"id": "J", "text": "manage"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["equitable", "consecutive", "representative", "deposit", "rights", "quotation", "infringements", "quota", "irresistible", "manage"], "correctAnswer": "representative"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["equitable", "consecutive", "representative", "deposit", "rights", "quotation", "infringements", "quota", "irresistible", "manage"], "correctAnswer": "manage"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["equitable", "consecutive", "representative", "deposit", "rights", "quotation", "infringements", "quota", "irresistible", "manage"], "correctAnswer": "equitable"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["equitable", "consecutive", "representative", "deposit", "rights", "quotation", "infringements", "quota", "irresistible", "manage"], "correctAnswer": "rights"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["equitable", "consecutive", "representative", "deposit", "rights", "quotation", "infringements", "quota", "irresistible", "manage"], "correctAnswer": "quota"}]'::jsonb,
