    ('pte-em-ra-002', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Association Between Meatless Diet', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Association between meatless diet and depression: participants who excluded meat from their diet were found to have a higher prevalence of depressive episodes as compared to participants who consumed meat. This association is independent of socioeconomic, lifestyle factors, and nutrient deficiencies.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
