    ('pte-em-ra-003', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Covid-19 Pandemic Is Linked', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Covid-19 pandemic is linked to early onset of puberty in some girls. Several studies suggest that the number of girls starting puberty early has more than doubled amid the coronavirus outbreak, and experts are unsure about exactly why.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-004', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Every Few Seconds, Our', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Every few seconds, our eyelids automatically shutter and our eyeballs roll back in their sockets. So why doesn''t blinking plunge us into intermittent darkness and light? New research shows that the brain works extra hard to stabilize our vision despite our fluttering eyes. When our eyeballs roll back in their sockets during a blink, they don''t always return to the same spot when we reopen our eyes.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-005', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'The Role Of Women', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'The role of women in promoting voluntary medical male circumcision uptake: research reveals the important role played by women in influencing men to undergo circumcision. Women are also motivated to convince men to undergo male circumcision because of the benefits associated with them such as reduction of HIV transmission and cervical cancer.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-006', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'In Every Cultivated Language', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'In every cultivated language there are two great classes of words which, taken together, comprise the whole vocabulary. First, there are those words with which we become acquainted in daily conversation, which we learn from the members of our own family and from our familiar associates, and which we should know and use even if we could not read or write.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-007', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'When Someone Commits A', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'When someone commits a criminal act, we always hope the punishment will match the offense. But when it comes to one of the cruelest crimes, animal fighting, things rarely work out that way. Dog-fighting victims are tortured and killed for profit and "sport", yet their criminal abusers often receive a minimal sentence for causing a lifetime of pain.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-008', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Bolstered By The Result', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Bolstered by the result of laboratory experiments, researchers dare to say that gaming might be mentally enriching. These scholars are the first to admit that games could be addictive, and indeed part of their research explores how games connect to the reward circuit of human beings.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-009', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Despite Many Similarities With', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Despite many similarities with literary-political debates in other nations, there are also ways in which the cultural and political situation in Scotland has left the study of Scottish Literature in a significantly different condition from that of literary studies in many other parts of the world.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-010', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'An Environment Of Rapid', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'An environment of rapid change, technological innovations and increasing business competitiveness has highlighted the growing importance of management development. In particular, the general movement towards great employee involvement and making things happen through people has emphasized an integrating rather than a controlling style of management.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-011', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'The Central Idea Of', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'The central idea of this book concerns our blindness with respect to randomness, particularly the large deviations: why do we, scientists or non-scientists, hotshots or regular Joes, tend to see the pennies instead of the dollars? Why do we keep focusing on the minutiae, not the possible significant large events, in spite of the obvious evidence of their huge influence?', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-012', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Psychology Is The Study', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Psychology is the study of cognitions, emotions, and behavior. Psychologists are involved in a variety of tasks. Many spend their careers designing and performing research to understand how people behave in specific situations, how and why we think the way we do, and how emotions develop and what impact they have on our interactions with others.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-013', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Efficiency Is Not Your', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Efficiency is not your friend when it comes to cognitive growth. In order to keep our brains making new connections and keep them active, you need to keep moving on to another challenging activity as soon as you reach the point of mastery in the one you were engaging in.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-014', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Using Artificial Intelligence, Researchers', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Using artificial intelligence, researchers can create photorealistic images from three- dimensional scenery, paving the way for better driving simulators and better testing of driverless cars.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-015', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Political Scholars Had Historically', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Political scholars had historically recognized the social love of the mass media. The impact of the mass media on the electric and governing process has greatly increased over the last fifty years. Tomorrow, the mass media will become the "central nervous system" for your society and the major source of public information.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-016', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Summer Research Scholarships Offer', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Summer Research scholarships offer a unique opportunity for external organizations, academics, and students to work together in research. Working with globally recognized researchers in a local setting, students gain valuable real-world experience as well as an insight into what research is all about.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-017', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Changes In Climate Affect', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Changes in climate affect, for example, the plant and animal life of a given area. The presence of coal beds in North America and Europe along with evidence of glaciation in these same areas indicates that they must have experienced alternately warmer and colder climates than they now possess.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-018', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'To Prevent Mosquito-Transmitted Diseases', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'To prevent mosquito-transmitted diseases, approaches based on genetic control of insect populations are being developed. However, many of these strategies are based on highly invasive, self-propagating transgenes that can rapidly spread the trait into other populations of mosquitoes.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-019', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Investigations Like This One', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Investigations like this one have been plodding along for 40 years, and some studies - like one following the deadly Kobe quake in 1995 - have found similar correlations. But study author Alasdair Skelton, a professor of geochemistry at Stockholm University, says the unpredictable study subject makes it tough to get funding because you can in no way guarantee a result. So l get three years of money, but if there''s no earthquake, there''s no result.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-020', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'James Webb Space Telescope', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'James Webb Space Telescope was specifically designed to observe this light, which comes from some of the oldest galaxies to take form. How did early stars and galaxies take shape? What about the cosmic material that is undetectable, known as dark matter? Is there evidence for it in the early eons of the universe? These are some of the perplexing and fascinating questions that astronomers can begin unraveling with Webb.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-021', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Deep Brain Stimulation (Dbs)', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Deep brain stimulation (DBS) to the superolateral branch of the medial forebrain bundle (MFB), which is linked to reward and motivation, revealed metabolic brain changes over 12 months post-DBS implantation, making it a strong potential therapy for treatment-resistant depression.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-022', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Research Has Shown That', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Research has shown that the gut microbiome is important for human physiology and health. Disturbances to the composition of the gut microbiome can be associated with chronic diseases such as gastrointestinal inflammatory disorders, neurological, cardiovascular and respiratory illnesses. The human body has evolved strategies to ensure that a symbiotic relationship exists between the microbes in our gut and our cells.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-023', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Research Has Found We', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Research has found we pursue more rewards when we become ''habituated'' to a higher standard of living and compare ourselves to various standards. What it takes to be happy depends on our prior expectations, but these expectations can change over time.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-024', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'The Dyes And Pigments', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'The dyes and pigments available in any particular period in which a specific color photographic process was invented, manufactured and used have profound effects on the quality of color that defines most of the style and particular historical period.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-025', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Cool Room Temperature Inhibited', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Cool room temperature inhibited cancer growth in mice: mice acclimatized to temperatures of 4°C had significantly slower tumor growth and lived nearly twice as long compared with mice in rooms of 30°C because they were burning more brown fat.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-026', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'One Of The Major', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'One of the major factors influencing future home design will be the probable change in climate, with hotter summers, colder winters, and the possibility of floods. Consequently, houses will be built with better insulation and will also need ways of keeping cool in hot weather, whether that''s air conditioning or more shading of windows.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-027', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Adult And Adolescent Cannabis', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Adult and adolescent cannabis users are no more likely than non-users to lack motivation or be unable to enjoy life''s pleasure, new research has shown, suggesting there is no scientific basis for the stereotype often portrayed in the media.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-028', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Intangible Assets Perform A', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Intangible assets perform a number of distinctive functions in the life of each company. Firstly, they witness the prosperity of the firm in its good name. Such a position allows human resource management to employ professional workers and increase labor productivity. Moreover, intangible assets guarantee future value for the firm. And although it is difficult to destroy intangible assets, they can lose their importance in case of carelessness or business failure.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-029', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Countries Bordering The Mediterranean', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Countries bordering the Mediterranean have built up a solid reputation for sunshine, great tasting food as well as impressive health statistics, featuring some of the lowest rates of heart disease, and increased life expectancy. This has created a lot of attention towards the Mediterranean diet, which is not a typical weight loss diet, but more of a set of habits.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-030', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'The Executive Residence In', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'The Executive Residence in the White House in the United States of America, where the president resides, is divided into several wings. It also includes the vice-president''s and president''s staff''s offices. This government building is a national heritage.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-031', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Whether Salamander Frog Or', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Whether salamander frog or toad, amphibians are some of the most diverse and far- flung animals on the planet. However, they''re disappearing, and experts are worried since frogs are considered bellwethers for the environment. Their double life makes them unique. It''s through their skin that they breathe and drink water because their skin is so permeable.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-032', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Symptoms Of Depression Decrease', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Symptoms of depression decrease with improvements in sense of smell, particularly among patients with dyssomnia. New research published in the journal Scientific Reports highlights the intricate relationship between depression and sense of smell. The study found that participants'' symptoms of depression dropped as their odor identification improved, particularly among those with an impaired sense of smell.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-033', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Written By Ten Eminent', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Written by ten eminent professors, it had been updated to reflect the shifts of sociological thought in the last five years, making it the most comprehensive, authoritative, and contemporary dictionary available. It was essential reading for all students and teachers of sociologies and other related courses, and also for the general reader.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-034', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Certain Types Of Methodology', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Certain types of methodology are more suitable for some research projects than others. For example, the use of questionnaires and surveys is more suitable for quantitative research whereas interviews and focus groups are more often used for qualitative research purposes.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-035', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Pluto Was One Of', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Pluto was one of the nine planets recognized to our solar system. But in 2021, it was relegated to the official status of dwarf planet by the international astronomical union (IAU). It will bring into clear focus once more what is, and what isn''t, meant by the term planet.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-036', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'This Finding Is Understandable', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'This finding is understandable in certain cases in spite of its high significance; that is because energy efficiency of building operation just represents a single aspect of sustainability.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-037', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Market Research Is Vital', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Market research is vital part of the planning of any business. However, experienced you or your staff may be in a particular field, if you are thinking of introducing a service to a new area, it is important to find out what the local population thinks about it first.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-038', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Researchers Gathered 160 Uncaffeinated', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Researchers gathered 160 uncaffeinated adults, people who consumed less than 500 milligrams of caffeine a week. These decaf subjects looked at pictures of various objects, then took either a placebo or a pill containing 200 milligrams of caffeine. That''s roughly the amount you''d get from two cups of coffee.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
     ARRAY['PTE', 'Exam Memories', 'Read Aloud']::text[], NULL, NULL, 0, TRUE, 40, NULL),
    ('pte-em-ra-039', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud',
     'Studies Funded By The', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.',
     'Studies funded by the soft drink industry are more likely to mask links to obesity and type two diabetes, according to a new report. He added that biases in industry funded studies were not usually due to poor methodology, but due to inherent problems in their design, including poor choice of comparators and problems with the way data is analysed and reported.', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
     'Speak clearly and naturally at an even pace with appropriate phrasing and intonation.', 15, 'medium',
